    "fruttita_prose": {
      "type": "fruttita-prose",
      "blocks": {
        "prose_p1": {
          "type": "text_paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text_paragraph": "Fruttita，把热带旷野里的那份干净和野，带进日常。",
            "text_paragraph_en": "Fruttita is tropical fruit, barely touched. The wild kind.",
            "text_paragraph_pt": "Fruttita é fruta tropical, quase intocada. Do tipo selvagem."
          }
        },
        "prose_p2": {
          "type": "text_paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text_paragraph": "在非洲，有一种活了三千年的树。当地人叫它“生命之树”。",
            "text_paragraph_en": "In Africa, there's a tree that's been around for 3,000 years. They call it the \"Tree of Life.\"",
            "text_paragraph_pt": "Em África, há uma árvore que existe há 3.000 anos. Chamam-lhe a \"Árvore da Vida.\""
          }
        },
        "prose_p3": {
          "type": "text_paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text_paragraph": "它不靠人工催熟，不靠化学干预。只是在赤道阳光下，沉默地生长，把旷野最纯粹的能量，锁进果实里。",
            "text_paragraph_en": "No one ripens it. No one sprays it. It just grows under the equatorial sun and dries on the branch.",
            "text_paragraph_pt": "Ninguém a amadurece. Ninguém a pulveriza. Cresce ao sol equatorial e seca no ramo."
          }
        },
        "prose_p4": {
          "type": "text_paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text_paragraph": "我们做的事很简单——把这份能量，变成你随时可以喝的东西。",
            "text_paragraph_en": "We turn that into something you can drink.",
            "text_paragraph_pt": "Nós transformamos isso em algo que podes beber."
          }
        },
        "prose_p5": {
          "type": "text_paragraph",
          "settings": {
            "text_paragraph": "不加糖，不加添加剂，不加任何你不需要的。",
            "text_paragraph_en": "No added sugar. No additives. That's it.",
            "text_paragraph_pt": "Sem açúcar adicionado. Sem aditivos. É isso."
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "prose_p1",
        "prose_p2",
        "prose_p3",
        "prose_p4",
        "prose_p5"
      ],
